Two-Headed Giant (Commander Duels v0.5.0 spike), part 2 of 2: shared life and team poison.

Reason: 810.4 and 810.9: a team has one life total. Damage, loss of life and gaining life happen to
each player, and the result is the team's total, which each teammate then has (so every effect that
reads a player's life reads the team's, 810.9a); a player can't gain or lose life when a teammate
can't (810.9g, 810.9h). 810.10 and 810.8d: poison counters are given to each player but counted for
the team, and a team loses at 15. The loss threshold and the count are overridable methods of
GameImpl, 10 and the player's own counters by default, so other games are unchanged.
Needs part 1 (Game.getTeammates).
Upstream: none yet; to be offered to magefree/mage with part 1.
Remove when: XMage upstream implements Two-Headed Giant's life and poison, or the format is dropped.

